## 委派流程时序

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Supervisor
    participant F as AgentFactory
    participant A as SubAgent
    participant T as Tools

    S->>F: create("coding")
    F-->>S: SubAgent 实例
    S->>A: execute(task, context)
    A->>A: 构造 prompt
    loop ReAct 循环
        A->>T: 调用工具
        T-->>A: 工具结果
    end
    A-->>S: HandoffResult
    S->>S: 记录结果，继续调度
```

